166	<summary>🏋️ Exercise (click to expand)</summary>
167	
168	**Challenge**: Implement a `CountdownFuture` that counts down from N to 0, printing the current count each time it's polled. When it reaches 0, it completes with `Ready("Liftoff!")`.
